# Largest Element in an Array

**Topic:** Arrays
**Difficulty:** Easy

## Problem
Given an array of integers, find and return the largest element in the array.

## https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/largest-element-in-array4009/1
```csharp
public class Solution {
    public int Largest(List<int> arr) {
        int largest = arr[0];
        for (int i = 1; i < arr.Count; i++)
        {
            if (arr[i] > largest)
            {
                largest = arr[i];
            }
        }
        return largest;
    }
}
```

## Complexity
- Time: O(n) — single pass through the array/list
- Space: O(1) — no extra space used

## Notes
- Arrays use `.Length`, Lists use `.Count` — same logic, different property name
- Careful with loop bounds: `i < length`, not `<=`, to avoid index out of range
